cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  modelling-paper-writer: a Claude Code skill for writing
  infectious disease modelling papers
message: If you use this skill, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: James
    family-names: Azam
    alias: jamesmbaazam
repository-code: https://github.com/jamesmbaazam/modelling-paper-writer
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code skill for writing infectious disease mathematical,
  statistical and machine learning modelling papers, distilled from the
  writing style of 37 well-written papers published between 2000 and 2024.
  Encodes conventions for paper structure, presentation of models and
  assumptions, reporting of estimates and uncertainty, literature
  positioning, voice, machine learning practice, and limitations.
keywords:
  - infectious disease modelling
  - epidemiology
  - scientific writing
  - mathematical modelling
  - machine learning
  - claude code
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-09-10'
